\]

Here (1) is a local presentation of the already global G3T perfect/transform
object. It is not a claim that the generally non-torsion BHT gerbe admits a
global rank-one alpha-twisted line.

For a degree-three line on an elliptic curve, the polarization morphism

\[
 \varphi_N:E^*\longrightarrow \operatorname{Pic}^0(E^*),
 \qquad h\longmapsto T_h^*N\otimes N^{-1}                \tag{2}
\]

